hived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","number":24,"title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-03-31T11:29:01Z","updated_at":"2026-04-21T14:32:54Z","closed_at":"2026-04-21T13:54:45Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118032","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118032","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118032.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118032.patch","merged_at":"2026-04-21T13:54:45Z"},"body":"* Fixes #118011.\r\n* Resolves #118007.\r\n\r\nPreviously, when a function's return type was unspecified, GDScript attempted to infer it based on the presence or absence of `return` statements in the function body (`Variant` or `void`). However, this is incorrect, since functions can be overridden in child classes, and abstract methods have no bodies at all. I think it's more correct to infer `Variant` in the case of an unspecified return type (or copy the return type from the parent method when overriding).\r\n\r\nThere is one subtle point. If you explicitly specify the `Variant` type (or it's copied from the parent method), you must return some value. However, if the return type isn't specified, you aren't required to return a value. This internal flag (`GDScriptParser::DataType::type_source`) is implicitly copied, but it's not distinguishable in `MethodInfo` reflection and documentation (`Variant` is used regardless of the presence or absence of the flag). However, I don't think we need to distinguish between these two options (#118007) - if a method returns a `Variant`, you can always use `return null` in code generation. In my opinion, the only problem is that reflection incorrectly reported the method as `void`.\r\n\r\nI'll also ignore for now the issue that GDScript sometimes treats `return` as `return null`. This can be somewhat complicated, which we can address later. See also https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/79363#pullrequestreview-1598144070.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118032/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118032/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}